creatures:
- name: Dragon Turtle
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 20  
      **Hit Points** 356 (rollable(dice=23d20 + 115,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 20 ft., Swim 50 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Initiative) (16)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=25)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+11,label=+11,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Damage Resistances** fire  
      **Senses** darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 11  
      **Languages** Draconic, Primordial (Aquan)  
      **Challenge** 17 (18,000 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +6  

      ## Traits

      ***Amphibious.*** The dragon can breathe air and water.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The dragon makes three Bite attacks. It can replace one attack with a Tail attack.

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+13,label=+13,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 15 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d10+7,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Fire damage. Being underwater doesn't grant ***Resistance*** to this Fire damage.

      ***Tail.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+13,label=+13,dicelabel=To Hit [Tail]), reach 15 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d10+7,dicelabel=Damage [Tail]) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Huge or smaller creature, it has the ***Prone*** condition.

      ***Steam Breath (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Steam Breath])).*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 19, each creature in a 60-foot ***Cone***. *Failure:* rollable(dice=16d6,dicelabel=Damage [Steam Breath]) Fire damage. *Success:* Half damage. *Failure or Success:* Being underwater doesn't grant ***Resistance*** to this Fire damage.

    type: custom
